00:29:42,069 --> 00:30:00,756
So it seems like they were actually butting heads with the domes, which is cool because the domed head of pachycephalosaurs, the dinosaurs that had these helmet-like heads, has often been attributed to head-butting, but that's also been brought under question as, "Do we actually have solid evidence that that's what they were doing?"

