00:47:14,251 --> 00:47:21,333
So first and foremost, what actually counts as a supercontinent is not strictly defined.

448
00:47:21,793 --> 00:47:25,515
So the idea, sort of if you ask somebody, you say, "Well, what is a supercontinent?"

