00:55:27,993 --> 00:55:32,455
The distribution of fossils lines up across some of these continents.

534
00:55:32,966 --> 00:55:38,948
So there are, when you put Africa and South America together, you are completing certain geologic formations.

535
00:55:39,148 --> 00:55:46,951
Yeah, things that ran into the edge of Africa and seemingly into the ocean actually continued over on to South America.

