00:58:53,612 --> 00:58:55,493
It has subducted back to the mantle.

581
00:58:55,753 --> 00:58:59,374
By the mechanisms of that system it is not allowed.

582
00:58:59,504 --> 00:59:08,668
What's left of that oceanic crust on the surface is igneous rock that re-emerged that was completely melted down and then re-erupted.

583
00:59:08,828 --> 00:59:10,709
That has been literally reset.

584
00:59:10,969 --> 00:59:11,169
Yes.

585
00:59:11,569 --> 00:59:13,230
So that's such an interesting.

